      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ULTIMATE ARK (9) finished second last time out, beaten a neck, in a nice return to form at this track over 1780m. Draws out a little on the second line and may need luck at some point. Meets a comparable field and he can go right on with the job. HEZA MAYWYN (7) produced a strong performance last time when he battled on bravely to just miss out over 1780m here. No harm in drawing here with the sprint lane to rely upon and is good enough to win a race of this calibre. SHEZ A PUNTER (3) is better than her last-start seventh over 1660m at Albion Park. This easier and worth another chance. OUR ULTIMATE MILLY (2) is in the mix at her first run since finishing fifth over 2138m at Albion Park four-and-a-half months ago. Can run a race while fresh.",
